{"title": "Kviz o koži | Izradite svoj osobni plan seruma | Tava Labs", "description": "Odgovorite na nekoliko brzih pitanja i izradite svoj osobni plan oko proizvoda PDRN Brightening Serum. Jedan serum, dvaput dnevno, prilagođen vašoj koži i vašim ciljevima.", "contentHtml": "\n\n<div class=\"wrap\">\n  <header class=\"top\">\n    <div class=\"wordmark\">TAVA<small>LABS</small></div>\n    <span style=\"font-size:12.5px;color:var(--muted);\">PDRN Brightening Serum</span>\n  </header>\n\n  <div class=\"progress-zone\" id=\"progressZone\" hidden>\n    <div class=\"progress-meta\">\n      <button class=\"backbtn\" id=\"backBtn\" type=\"button\">&larr; Natrag</button>\n      <span id=\"stepLabel\"></span>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"bar\"><div id=\"barFill\"></div></div>\n  </div>\n\n  <!-- 1 · HOOK -->\n  <section class=\"screen\" data-screen=\"hook\" data-progress=\"6\" data-step-label=\"6 pitanja do vašeg plana\">\n    <img class=\"bottle\" src=\"§IMG0§\" alt=\"Bočica proizvoda PDRN Brightening Serum tvrtke Tava Labs\">\n    <p class=\"eyebrow\">Izgradite svoj osobni plan od 30 dana</p>\n    <h1>Jedan serum. Dvaput dnevno. <em>30 dana.</em></h1>\n    <p class=\"lede\">Odgovorite na nekoliko brzih pitanja i izgradit ćemo vaš osobni plan od 30 dana oko PDRN Brightening Serum, jedan korak ujutro i jedan korak navečer. Pretplata, a možete pauzirati ili otkazati u bilo kojem trenutku.</p>\n    <button class=\"cta\" type=\"button\" data-next>Izradi moj plan</button>\n    <p class=\"note\">PDRN Brightening Serum · 1 fl oz (30 ml) · Napravljeno za upotrebu dvaput dnevno</p>\n  </section>\n\n  <!-- 2 · Q1 GOAL -->\n  <section class=\"screen\" data-screen=\"goal\" data-progress=\"14\" data-step-label=\"Još 6\">\n    <h2>Što najviše želite od sljedećih 30 dana?</h2>\n    <div class=\"choices\" data-choice-group=\"goal\">\n      <button class=\"choice\" type=\"button\" data-value=\"radiance\"><span class=\"t\">Koža svjetlijeg izgleda</span></button>\n      <button class=\"choice\" type=\"button\" data-value=\"fine_lines\"><span class=\"t\">Sitne bore</span></button>\n      <button class=\"choice\" type=\"button\" data-value=\"hydration\"><span class=\"t\">Dubinska hidratacija</span></button>\n      <button class=\"choice\" type=\"button\" data-value=\"even_tone\"><span class=\"t\">Ujednačen ton</span></button>\n    </div>\n  </section>\n\n  <!-- 3 · INTERSTITIAL 1 -->\n  <section class=\"screen\" data-screen=\"notalone\" data-progress=\"24\">\n    <p class=\"eyebrow\">Niste sami</p>\n    <h2 id=\"naTitle\">Niste sami.</h2>\n    <p class=\"lede\" id=\"naBody\"></p>\n    <button class=\"cta\" type=\"button\" data-next>Nastavi dalje</button>\n  </section>\n\n  <!-- 4 · Q2 SKIN TYPE -->\n  <section class=\"screen\" data-screen=\"skinType\" data-progress=\"34\" data-step-label=\"Još 5\">\n    <h2>Kako se vaša koža obično osjeća do podneva?</h2>\n    <div class=\"choices\" data-choice-group=\"skinType\">\n      <button class=\"choice\" type=\"button\" data-value=\"dry\"><span class=\"t\">Suha</span></button>\n      <button class=\"choice\" type=\"button\" data-value=\"oily\"><span class=\"t\">Masna</span></button>\n      <button class=\"choice\" type=\"button\" data-value=\"combination\"><span class=\"t\">Mješovita</span></button>\n      <button class=\"choice\" type=\"button\" data-value=\"sensitive\"><span class=\"t\">Osjetljiva</span></button>\n      <button class=\"choice\" type=\"button\" data-value=\"not_sure\"><span class=\"t\">Ne znam</span></button>\n    </div>\n  </section>\n\n  <!-- 5 · Q3 CONCERN -->\n  <section class=\"screen\" data-screen=\"concern\" data-progress=\"46\" data-step-label=\"Još 4\">\n    <h2>A vaša glavna briga trenutačno?</h2>\n    <div class=\"choices\" data-choice-group=\"concern\">\n      <button class=\"choice\" type=\"button\" data-value=\"dullness\"><span class=\"t\">Beživotan izgled</span></button>\n      <button class=\"choice\" type=\"button\" data-value=\"fine_lines\"><span class=\"t\">Sitne bore</span></button>\n      <button class=\"choice\" type=\"button\" data-value=\"uneven_tone\"><span class=\"t\">Neujednačen ton</span></button>\n      <button class=\"choice\" type=\"button\" data-value=\"texture\"><span class=\"t\">Gruba tekstura</span></button>\n      <button class=\"choice\" type=\"button\" data-value=\"dryness\"><span class=\"t\">Suhoća</span></button>\n    </div>\n  </section>\n\n  <!-- 6 · INTERSTITIAL 2 · FORMULA MATCH -->\n  <section class=\"screen\" data-screen=\"match\" data-progress=\"56\">\n    <p class=\"eyebrow\">Formula prilagođena vama</p>\n    <h2>Unutar bočice, prilagođeno vašim odgovorima</h2>\n    <p class=\"lede\" style=\"margin-bottom:2px;\">Jedna fiksna formula. Evo koji sastojci odgovaraju onome što ste nam upravo rekli.</p>\n    <div class=\"cardbox\" id=\"matchBox\"></div>\n    <button class=\"cta\" type=\"button\" data-next>Nastavi</button>\n  </section>\n\n  <!-- 7 · Q4 SENSITIVITY -->\n  <section class=\"screen\" data-screen=\"sensitivity\" data-progress=\"64\" data-step-label=\"Još 3\">\n    <h2>Je li vaša koža prije reagirala na jake proizvode?</h2>\n    <div class=\"choices\" data-choice-group=\"sensitivity\">\n      <button class=\"choice\" type=\"button\" data-value=\"often\"><span class=\"t\">Da, lako</span></button>\n      <button class=\"choice\" type=\"button\" data-value=\"sometimes\"><span class=\"t\">Ponekad</span></button>\n      <button class=\"choice\" type=\"button\" data-value=\"never\"><span class=\"t\">Rijetko</span></button>\n    </div>\n  </section>\n\n  <!-- 8 · Q5 ROUTINE -->\n  <section class=\"screen\" data-screen=\"routine\" data-progress=\"74\" data-step-label=\"Još 2\">\n    <h2>Kako danas izgleda vaša rutina?</h2>\n    <div class=\"choices\" data-choice-group=\"routine\">\n      <button class=\"choice\" type=\"button\" data-value=\"cleanser_only\"><span class=\"t\">Samo sredstvo za čišćenje</span></button>\n      <button class=\"choice\" type=\"button\" data-value=\"few_products\"><span class=\"t\">Nekoliko proizvoda</span></button>\n      <button class=\"choice\" type=\"button\" data-value=\"full_routine\"><span class=\"t\">Potpuna rutina</span></button>\n    </div>\n  </section>\n\n  <!-- 9 · Q6 ROUTINE TIMES -->\n  <section class=\"screen\" data-screen=\"times\" data-progress=\"84\" data-step-label=\"Posljednje pitanje\">\n    <h2>Kada ćete ga nanositi?</h2>\n    <label class=\"f\">Jutro</label>\n    <div class=\"chips\" data-time-chips=\"amTime\">\n      <button class=\"chip\" type=\"button\" data-value=\"06:30\">6:30 AM</button>\n      <button class=\"chip\" type=\"button\" data-value=\"07:30\">7:30 AM</button>\n      <button class=\"chip\" type=\"button\" data-value=\"08:30\">8:30 AM</button>\n    </div>\n    <input type=\"time\" id=\"amCustom\" aria-label=\"Prilagođeno jutarnje vrijeme\" style=\"margin-top:10px;\">\n    <label class=\"f\">Večer</label>\n    <div class=\"chips\" data-time-chips=\"pmTime\">\n      <button class=\"chip\" type=\"button\" data-value=\"21:00\">9:00 PM</button>\n      <button class=\"chip\" type=\"button\" data-value=\"22:00\">10:00 PM</button>\n      <button class=\"chip\" type=\"button\" data-value=\"22:30\">10:30 PM</button>\n    </div>\n    <input type=\"time\" id=\"pmCustom\" aria-label=\"Prilagođeno večernje vrijeme\" style=\"margin-top:10px;\">\n    <div style=\"height:22px\"></div>\n    <button class=\"cta\" type=\"button\" data-next>Nastavi</button>\n  </section>\n\n  <!-- 10 · EMAIL -->\n  <section class=\"screen\" data-screen=\"email\" data-progress=\"92\" data-step-label=\"Još malo\">\n    <h2>Kamo da pošaljemo vaš 30-dnevni plan?</h2>\n    <p class=\"lede\">Vaš plan ide u vašu pristiglu poštu. Koristite istu e-poštu kad preuzmete aplikaciju, jer tako će vas aplikacija prepoznati, a vaši odgovori, plan i narudžba čekat će vas tamo.</p>\n    <label class=\"f\" for=\"emailInput\">Adresa e-pošte</label>\n    <input type=\"email\" id=\"emailInput\" autocomplete=\"email\" placeholder=\"you@example.com\">\n    <div class=\"banner err\" id=\"emailErr\">Ta e-pošta ne izgleda potpuno. Provjerite je i pokušajte ponovno.</div>\n    <div style=\"height:18px\"></div>\n    <button class=\"cta\" type=\"button\" id=\"emailNext\">Prikaži moj plan</button>\n  </section>\n\n  <!-- 11 · PLAN REVEAL — treatment preview -->\n  <section class=\"screen\" data-screen=\"plan\" data-progress=\"97\" data-step-label=\"Vaš plan\">\n    <div class=\"planhero\">\n      <p class=\"plan-eyebrow\">Pregled vašeg tretmana</p>\n      <p class=\"plan-brand\">Tava Labs</p>\n      <h2 id=\"planTitle\">PDRN Brightening Serum</h2>\n      <div class=\"plan-bottle\"><img src=\"/assets/products/pdrn-bright-serum/view-1-mockup.jpg\" alt=\"Bočica proizvoda PDRN Brightening Serum\"></div>\n      <p class=\"basedon\">Odabrano na temelju vaših ciljeva:</p>\n      <div class=\"goalchips\" id=\"goalChips\"></div>\n      <p class=\"priceline\">Planovi počinju od <strong>$39/month*</strong></p>\n      <p class=\"fineprint\">*Plaća se mjesečno. Pauzirajte ili otkažite u bilo kojem trenutku.<br>Bočica za jednokratnu kupnju $49.</p>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"cardbox\" style=\"margin-top:14px\">\n        <p style=\"font-family:Kanit,sans-serif;font-size:12px;font-weight:600;letter-spacing:2.5px;color:#B78B45;margin:0 0 8px\">VAŠ PRVI TJEDAN</p>\n        <p style=\"margin:0 0 14px\">Vaši su odgovori već mapirali prvi tjedan vaše rutine. Nakon prva dva dana slijedi još pet dana, a prvi dan počinje onog trenutka kada vaš serum bude poslan.</p>\n        <div style=\"display:flex;gap:8px\" aria-hidden=\"true\">\n          <span style=\"flex:1;text-align:center;padding:9px 0;border-radius:10px;background:#123B2C;color:#D8C19A;font-family:Kanit,sans-serif;font-weight:600;font-size:13px\">Dan 1</span>\n          <span style=\"flex:1;text-align:center;padding:9px 0;border-radius:10px;background:#123B2C;color:#D8C19A;font-family:Kanit,sans-serif;font-weight:600;font-size:13px\">Dan 2</span>\n          <span style=\"flex:1;text-align:center;padding:9px 0;border-radius:10px;border:1.5px solid rgba(18,16,12,.25);font-family:Kanit,sans-serif;font-weight:600;font-size:13px\">Dan 3</span>\n          <span style=\"flex:1;text-align:center;padding:9px 0;border-radius:10px;border:1.5px solid rgba(18,16,12,.25);font-family:Kanit,sans-serif;font-weight:600;font-size:13px\">Dan 4</span>\n          <span style=\"flex:1;text-align:center;padding:9px 0;border-radius:10px;border:1.5px solid rgba(18,16,12,.25);font-family:Kanit,sans-serif;font-weight:600;font-size:13px\">Dan 5</span>\n          <span style=\"flex:1;text-align:center;padding:9px 0;border-radius:10px;border:1.5px solid rgba(18,16,12,.25);font-family:Kanit,sans-serif;font-weight:600;font-size:13px\">Dan 6</span>\n          <span style=\"flex:1;text-align:center;padding:9px 0;border-radius:10px;border:1.5px solid rgba(18,16,12,.25);font-family:Kanit,sans-serif;font-weight:600;font-size:13px\">Dan 7</span>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"cardbox detailscard\">\n      <h3>Detalji seruma</h3>\n      <p>Jedan serum. Dvaput dnevno. 30 dana.</p>\n      <div class=\"stats\">\n        <div class=\"stat\"><span class=\"sk\">Vrsta</span><span class=\"sv\">Serum za posvjetljivanje · 1 fl oz</span></div>\n        <div class=\"stat\"><span class=\"sk\">Upotreba</span><span class=\"sv\">Dvaput dnevno</span></div>\n        <div class=\"stat\"><span class=\"sk\">Plan</span><span class=\"sv\">30 dana</span></div>\n      </div>\n      <div id=\"planBox\"></div>\n      <details class=\"acc\" open>\n        <summary>Aktivni sastojci</summary>\n        <div class=\"ingcards\" role=\"list\" aria-label=\"Aktivni sastojci\">\n          <div class=\"ingcard\" role=\"listitem\"><span class=\"name\">PDRN</span><span class=\"sub\">Polydeoxyribonucleotide</span><img class=\"ingimg\" src=\"/assets/ingredients/ingredient-pdrn.png\" alt=\"Tekstura seruma PDRN\" loading=\"lazy\"><p class=\"benefit\">Za kožu svjetlijeg izgleda</p></div>\n          <div class=\"ingcard\" role=\"listitem\"><span class=\"name\">Acetyl Hexapeptide-8</span><span class=\"sub\">Peptid</span><img class=\"ingimg\" src=\"/assets/ingredients/ingredient-peptide.png\" alt=\"Tekstura seruma Acetyl Hexapeptide-8\" loading=\"lazy\"><p class=\"benefit\">Za kožu glađeg izgleda</p></div>\n          <div class=\"ingcard\" role=\"listitem\"><span class=\"name\">Sodium Hyaluronate</span><span class=\"sub\">Hijaluronska kiselina</span><img class=\"ingimg\" src=\"/assets/ingredients/ingredient-ha.png\" alt=\"Tekstura seruma Sodium Hyaluronate\" loading=\"lazy\"><p class=\"benefit\">Za duboku hidrataciju</p></div>\n          <div class=\"ingcard\" role=\"listitem\"><span class=\"name\">Panthenol</span><span class=\"sub\">Provitamin B5</span><div class=\"ingtex\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></div><p class=\"benefit\">Za meku, ugodnu kožu</p></div>\n        </div>\n        <p class=\"ingnote\">Kozmetički serum za lokalnu upotrebu. Samo za vanjsku upotrebu. Izbjegavajte oči. Prekinite upotrebu ako dođe do iritacije.</p>\n      </details>\n      <details class=\"acc\">\n        <summary>Kako koristiti</summary>\n        <p>Nanesite 2 do 4 pumpice na čistu, suhu kožu, dvaput dnevno. Zatim ujutro nanesite hidratantnu kremu ili kremu za sunčanje.</p>\n      </details>\n      <details class=\"acc\">\n        <summary>Dobro je znati</summary>\n        <p>Samo za vanjsku upotrebu. Izbjegavajte oči. Prekinite upotrebu ako dođe do iritacije. Čuvajte izvan dohvata djece. Ne koristite na oštećenoj koži. Čuvajte na hladnom i suhom mjestu.</p>\n      </details>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"featureband\">\n      <h3>Upoznajte svoj <em>serum</em></h3>\n      <div class=\"feature\">\n        <img src=\"/assets/products/pdrn-bright-serum/view-1-mockup.jpg\" alt=\"Bočica proizvoda PDRN Brightening Serum\">\n        <span class=\"callout c1\">Prezentacija i svjetlina</span>\n        <span class=\"callout c2\">Dubinska hidratacija</span>\n        <span class=\"callout c3\">Sitne bore</span>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n    <h3 class=\"featuretitle\">Stvarni rezultati</h3>\n    <div class=\"results\">\n      <figure class=\"resultcard\"><div class=\"resultimg\"><img src=\"/assets/before-after/D0DBB2D8-601B-46E8-BE29-A068C5DAF345.jpeg\" alt=\"Prije i poslije uz PDRN Brightening Serum\" loading=\"lazy\"></div><figcaption><span>Prije</span><span>Poslije</span></figcaption></figure>\n      <figure class=\"resultcard\"><div class=\"resultimg\"><img src=\"/assets/before-after/IMG_3056.jpeg\" alt=\"Prije i poslije uz PDRN Brightening Serum\" loading=\"lazy\"></div><figcaption><span>Prije</span><span>Poslije</span></figcaption></figure>\n      <figure class=\"resultcard\"><div class=\"resultimg\"><img src=\"/assets/before-after/IMG_3057.jpeg\" alt=\"Prije i poslije uz PDRN Brightening Serum\" loading=\"lazy\"></div><figcaption><span>Prije</span><span>Poslije</span></figcaption></figure>\n    </div>\n    <p class=\"resultsnote\">Pojedinačni rezultati se razlikuju.</p>\n    <div class=\"stickybar\">\n      <button class=\"cta\" type=\"button\" data-next>Nastavite s ovim planom</button>\n      <button class=\"altlink\" type=\"button\" data-next>Pogledajte druge mogućnosti</button>\n    </div>\n  </section>\n\n  <!-- 12 · OFFER + CHECKOUT -->\n  <section class=\"screen\" data-screen=\"checkout\" data-progress=\"99\" data-step-label=\"Naplata\">\n    <h2>Započnite svojih 30 dana</h2>\n    <div class=\"banner demo\" id=\"demoBanner\" hidden><strong>Demo naplata. Bez naplate.</strong> Ova stranica još nije povezana s krajnjom točkom za plaćanje ili ispunjenje narudžbi. Gumb u nastavku provjerava vaše podatke i sastavlja točan teret narudžbe, pa možete vidjeti točno što bi se poslalo.</div>\n    <div class=\"choices\" data-choice-group=\"purchaseType\" data-no-advance=\"1\">\n      <button class=\"choice\" type=\"button\" data-value=\"subscribe\"><span class=\"price\">$39</span><span class=\"t\">Pretplatite se &amp; uštedite</span></button>\n      <button class=\"choice\" type=\"button\" data-value=\"one_time\"><span class=\"price\">$49</span><span class=\"t\">Jednokratno</span></button>\n    </div>\n    <form id=\"shipForm\" novalidate>\n      <div class=\"grid2\">\n        <div><label class=\"f\" for=\"firstName\">Ime</label><input type=\"text\" id=\"firstName\" autocomplete=\"given-name\"></div>\n        <div><label class=\"f\" for=\"lastName\">Prezime</label><input type=\"text\" id=\"lastName\" autocomplete=\"family-name\"></div>\n      </div>\n      <label class=\"f\" for=\"address1\">Ulica i kućni broj</label>\n      <input type=\"text\" id=\"address1\" autocomplete=\"street-address\">\n      <label class=\"f\" for=\"address2\">Stan, apartman itd. <span class=\"opt\">(neobavezno)</span></label>\n      <input type=\"text\" id=\"address2\" autocomplete=\"address-line2\">\n      <div class=\"grid2\">\n        <div><label class=\"f\" for=\"city\">Grad</label><input type=\"text\" id=\"city\" autocomplete=\"address-level2\"></div>\n        <div><label class=\"f\" for=\"stateCode\">Savezna država</label><input type=\"text\" id=\"stateCode\" autocomplete=\"address-level1\" placeholder=\"CA\" maxlength=\"2\" style=\"text-transform:uppercase\"></div>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"grid2\">\n        <div><label class=\"f\" for=\"zip\">Poštanski broj</label><input type=\"text\" id=\"zip\" autocomplete=\"postal-code\" inputmode=\"numeric\"></div>\n        <div><label class=\"f\" for=\"countryCode\">Država</label>\n          <select id=\"countryCode\"><option value=\"US\" selected>Sjedinjene Američke Države</option><option value=\"CA\">Kanada</option><option value=\"GB\">Ujedinjeno Kraljevstvo</option><option value=\"AU\">Australija</option></select>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n      <label class=\"f\" for=\"phone\">Telefon <span class=\"opt\">(neobavezno, za obavijesti o dostavi)</span></label>\n      <input type=\"tel\" id=\"phone\" autocomplete=\"tel\">\n      <div class=\"banner err\" id=\"shipErr\"></div>\n      <div style=\"height:20px\"></div>\n      <button class=\"cta\" type=\"submit\" id=\"buyBtn\">Započni moju pretplatu, $39</button>\n      <p class=\"note\" id=\"payNote\">Pretplata se obnavlja svakih 30 dana po cijeni od $39. Pauzirajte ili otkažite u bilo kojem trenutku.</p>\n    </form>\n  </section>\n\n  <!-- 13 · THANK YOU -->\n  <section class=\"screen\" data-screen=\"thanks\">\n    <img class=\"bottle\" src=\"§IMG1§\" alt=\"Bočica proizvoda PDRN Brightening Serum\">\n    <p class=\"eyebrow\">Narudžba primljena</p>\n    <h2>Vaš plan<em>počinje sada.</em></h2>\n    <div class=\"banner demo\" id=\"thanksDemo\" hidden><strong>Demo naplata. Nije izvršena naplata.</strong> Teret vaše narudžbe spremljen je u ovom pregledniku kako biste mogli provjeriti točno što će verzija uživo poslati.</div>\n    <div class=\"cardbox\" id=\"thanksBox\"></div>\n    <h2 style=\"font-size:24px;\">Vaša kupnja pojavljuje se u aplikaciji</h2>\n    <p class=\"lede\" style=\"margin-bottom:16px;\">Vaš plan živi u aplikaciji Tava, s dnevnim potvrdama ujutro i navečer te vašim nizom i praćenjem vaše pošiljke. Aplikacija još nije na App Storeu. Nakon naplate, vaša stranica potvrde i e-pošta daju vam <strong>kod za preuzimanje</strong>. Kada instalirate aplikaciju, prijavite se i unesite taj kod, a vaš plan, odgovori i narudžba već su tamo. Bez ponovne kupnje.</p>\n    <!-- The app is not published yet, so there is deliberately no store\n         button here. The claim code on checkout/success.html (and in the\n         confirmation email) is the handoff. Add the real App Store link\n         next to the claim code once the app is listed. -->\n    <a class=\"cta\" href=\"/checkout/success\" id=\"appStoreBtn\">Pogledajte moj kod za preuzimanje nakon naplate</a>\n    <p class=\"note\" id=\"carryLine\"></p>\n  </section>\n\n  <footer>Tava Labs · PDRN Brightening Serum za osnivače · Pitanja? talia@tavalabs.app</footer>\n</div>\n\n\n"}